{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1246035-nuwisha-totem-trait","id":1246035,"title":"Nuwisha Totem Trait","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-14T13:14:14-07:00","id":1246035,"title":"Nuwisha Totem Trait","content":"Hello all, I joined this forum only recently, it had been for a different question previously, but now I'm going to be helping another player make a Nuwisha character very soon, we're using the Revised edition, but I read the 8 pages(130-137) in The Changing Breeds, but I have only skimmed the second edition Breedbook: Nuwisha, but I can't figure out why the Nuwisha have a Totem trait in place of Rage, everything I read about their totems seems to only describe them following one face of Coyote or talking about the Totem background, but do they get temporary totem points that can grant them extra actions in combat and do things like spending rage points? What is this totem trait, what does it do, does it start at a certain amount like how Auspice determines a Garou's starting rage?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24503-wulfswift","name":"Wulfswift","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T15:42:01-07:00","id":1246084,"title":"","content":"Nuwisha dont use Totem like Rage, they lack Rage completely unless they take certain Gifts. Their Totem Background trait reflects which 'face' of Coyote they follow. They get a pool of freebie totem points that are used to pay for which Face of Yote they follow, outside that they have to add points on their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T15:55:06-07:00","id":1246088,"title":"","content":"So it's literally just the totem background moved there? It does nothing extra special?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24503-wulfswift","name":"Wulfswift","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T18:24:43-07:00","id":1246143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wulfswift</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1246035-nuwisha-totem-trait?p=1246088#post1246088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it's literally just the totem background moved there? It does nothing extra special?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Correct. No extra actions for Nuwisha.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Dami